// Cells: ground plan, then the buildings and props stamped over it.
[
    // Ground plan: T t Y y forest (General's 2x2 pattern), . grass, , tall grass, * flowers, s signposts,
    // and SilBoisEther's (games/silice/gfx/SilBoisEther.ron, original art): : forest path,
    // = Team Cocket's glowing high-voltage cables (an obstacle), p the secret grove's hedge,
    // x synthetic brambles (8, 6), h the market's high-tech pot (4, 14), f the gardener's grey ferns (round her at (10, 7)),
    // n the old man's bench. b the Sector Beta barrier (33, 13-14), General's fence.
    // Connection strips stay primary-only (the engine draws and collides a neighbour's edge cells
    // with the current map's tilesets): every row y >= 18 (Route S1's seam, (12-15, 25)) and the east
    // side x >= 28, y 5-22 (Route S2's seam, (35, 12-15); the barrier included) use General only.
    // The east edge (x 35, y 12-15) is drawn as forest here; 05_ch2_connect.ron opens it to Route S2.
    Ascii(x: 0, y: 0, rows: [
        "TtTtTtTtTtTtTtTtTtTtTtTtTtTtTtTtTtTt",
        "YyYyYyYyYyYyYyYyYyYyYyYyYyYyYyYyYyYy",
