    Stamp(x: 18, y: 14, name: "SilBoisEther_maison_tronc"),
    Stamp(x: 9, y: 14, name: "SilBoisEther_maison_tronc"),
    // Roots tangled with glowing cables: by the oak, by the gardener, at the east cable's end.
